title: >-
  A Systematic Approach For Standardisation of Colours And
  Codes For Various Geological Formations Of Pakistan.
message: >-
  If you use this Article, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: Journal Article
authors:
  - given-names: Atif Ali Hassan
identifiers:
